<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ d.title }}</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#0A0D13;--panel:#111621;--line:#1E2633;--txt:#C7CDD8;--mut:#79828F;
--dim:#525b69;--accent:#5AA9FF;--good:#42B96A;--bad:#EF5E6B;--warn:#D6A34C;
--thead:#0E131C;--chartbg:#111621;
--mono:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
--sans:-apple-system,"Segoe UI",system-ui,sans-serif}
:root[data-theme="light"]{--bg:#f6f7f9;--panel:#ffffff;--line:#e4e8ee;--txt:#1a1f2b;
--mut:#5b6472;--dim:#8a93a3;--accent:#2f6fb0;--good:#2e9e4f;--bad:#d0362b;--warn:#b9822a;
--thead:#f0f2f5;--chartbg:#ffffff}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);font-family:var(--sans);margin:0;
padding:40px 20px 70px;line-height:1.5}
.doc{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}
.themebtn{position:fixed;top:14px;right:14px;z-index:20;font-family:var(--mono);
font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:7px 13px;border-radius:8px;
border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);color:var(--txt);cursor:pointer}
.themebtn:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;
text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 8px}
h1{font-size:28px;font-weight:600;margin:2px 0 6px}
h2{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:0}
.meta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);
border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
padding:10px 0;margin-top:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;
flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
section{margin-top:34px}
.lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;
text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mut);margin:0 0 14px;display:flex;
align-items:center;gap:10px}
.lbl::after{content:"";flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--line)}
/* stat cards */
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px}
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 15px}
.card .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);margin:0 0 6px}
.card .v{font-size:22px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.pos{color:var(--good)}.neg{color:var(--bad)}.warn{color:var(--warn)}.muted{color:var(--mut)}
/* chart cards — bg + baked chart image both follow the theme */
.chart{background:var(--chartbg);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin:0;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.chart img{width:100%;height:auto}
.chart img.c-light{display:none}.chart img.c-dark{display:block}
:root[data-theme="light"] .chart img.c-light{display:block}
:root[data-theme="light"] .chart img.c-dark{display:none}
.cap{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--mut);margin:8px 2px 0}
/* tables */
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);
border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:6px}
th{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;
color:var(--dim);text-align:left;padding:9px 12px;background:var(--thead);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
td{padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
td.r,th.r{text-align:right}
.mono{font-family:var(--mono)}
.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
.callout{background:rgba(90,169,255,.07);border-left:3px solid var(--accent);
padding:10px 14px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;margin:12px 0;font-size:13.5px}
ol.act{margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:20px}ol.act li{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13.5px}
.mode{font-size:13px;margin:8px 0}
.tag{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;
padding:2px 7px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--thead);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--mut)}
.foot{margin-top:40px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
/* print → force light chrome + light charts (better on paper) */
@media print{
  :root{--bg:#fff;--panel:#fff;--txt:#111;--line:#ddd;--dim:#666;--mut:#555;--thead:#f0f2f5;--chartbg:#fff}
  .chart img.c-dark{display:none!important}.chart img.c-light{display:block!important}
  .themebtn{display:none}body{padding:0}.doc{max-width:100%}
  .card,.chart,table{break-inside:avoid}section{break-inside:avoid-page}
}
@media (max-width:680px){.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head>
<body><div class="doc">
{% macro chart(obj, alt) %}<img class="c-dark" src="data:image/png;base64,{{ obj.dark }}" alt="{{ alt }}"><img class="c-light" src="data:image/png;base64,{{ obj.light }}" alt="{{ alt }}">{% endmacro %}
<button class="themebtn" id="themebtn" type="button">◑ Light</button>

<p class="eyebrow">Fluxus Capital · Performance Review (auto-generated)</p>
<h1>{{ d.title }}</h1>
{% if d.scope == 'month' %}
<div class="meta"><span>{{ d.period_label }}</span>
<span>{{ d.m.closed_n }} closed · {{ d.m.open_n }} open at month-end · equity {{ d.m.end_equity | money }}</span>
<span>{{ d.handle }} · generated {{ d.generated }}</span></div>

{# ---------- Monthly headline ---------- #}
<section>
<p class="lbl">概览 · Month headline (MTM, open positions marked)</p>
<div class="cards">
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Month return (MTM)</p><p class="v {{ 'pos' if d.m.ret>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ d.m.ret | pct(1) }}{% if d.m.prev_ret is not none %} <span class="muted" style="font-size:12px">vs {{ d.m.prev_ret | pct(1) }} 上月</span>{% endif %}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Month P&amp;L (MTM)</p><p class="v {{ 'pos' if d.m.pnl>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ d.m.pnl | money }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Realized (closed)</p><p class="v {{ 'pos' if d.m.realized>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ d.m.realized | money }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Cumulative return</p><p class="v {{ 'pos' if d.m.cum>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ d.m.cum | pct(1) }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Closed trades</p><p class="v">{{ d.m.closed_n }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Win rate</p><p class="v">{{ d.m.win_rate | pct0(1) if d.m.win_rate is not none else '—' }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Sum R / Payoff</p><p class="v {{ 'pos' if (d.m.sum_R or 0)>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ d.m.sum_R | signR }} <span class="muted" style="font-size:13px">· {{ d.m.payoff | num(2) if d.m.payoff is not none else '—' }}×</span></p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Max DD (month)</p><p class="v neg">{{ d.m.dd_pct | pct0(1) }}</p></div>
</div>
</section>
{% else %}
<div class="meta"><span>{{ d.period_label }}</span>
<span>{{ d.s.n }} closed trades · avg hold {{ d.s.avg_hold_days | num(1) }}d</span>
<span>{{ d.handle }} · generated {{ d.generated }}</span></div>

{# ---------- Headline ---------- #}
<section>
<p class="lbl">概览 · Headline</p>
<div class="cards">
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Return vs start</p><p class="v {{ 'pos' if d.s.return_pct>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ d.s.return_pct | pct(1) }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Net P&amp;L</p><p class="v {{ 'pos' if d.s.total_pnl>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ d.s.total_pnl | money }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Win rate</p><p class="v">{{ d.s.win_rate | pct0(1) }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Total R</p><p class="v {{ 'pos' if d.s.sum_R>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ d.s.sum_R | signR }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Payoff</p><p class="v">{{ d.s.payoff | num(2) }}×</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Profit factor</p><p class="v">{{ d.s.profit_factor | num(2) }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Expectancy</p><p class="v {{ 'pos' if d.s.expectancy>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ d.s.expectancy | money }}</p></div>
  {% if d.mtm and d.mtm.drawdown %}<div class="card"><p class="k">Max drawdown (MTM)</p><p class="v neg">{{ d.mtm.drawdown.pct | pct0(1) }}</p></div>
  {% else %}<div class="card"><p class="k">Ending equity</p><p class="v">{{ d.s.ending_equity | money }}</p></div>{% endif %}
</div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{# ---------- Equity curve ---------- #}
{% if d.charts.equity %}
<section>
<p class="lbl">{{ '本月权益曲线 · Intra-month equity (open positions marked)' if d.scope == 'month' else '盯市权益曲线 · Mark-to-market equity & drawdown' }}</p>
<div class="chart">{{ chart(d.charts.equity, 'Equity curve') }}</div>
{% if d.mtm and d.mtm.risk %}
<table><thead><tr><th>Peak equity</th><th class="r">Max DD</th><th class="r">DD window</th>
<th class="r">Sharpe</th><th class="r">Sortino</th><th class="r">Calmar</th><th class="r">CAGR</th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>{{ d.mtm.risk.peak_equity | money }} <span class="muted">(+{{ d.mtm.risk.peak_return_pct | num(0) }}%)</span></td>
<td class="r neg">{{ d.mtm.drawdown.pct | pct0(1) }}</td>
<td class="r mono">{{ d.mtm.drawdown.peak_date }} → {{ d.mtm.drawdown.trough_date }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ d.mtm.risk.sharpe | num(2) }}</td><td class="r">{{ d.mtm.risk.sortino | num(2) }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ d.mtm.risk.calmar | num(2) }}</td><td class="r">{{ (d.mtm.risk.cagr*100) | num(1) if d.mtm.risk.cagr is not none else '—' }}%</td>
</tr></tbody></table>{% endif %}
</section>{% endif %}

{# ---------- Open positions at month-end ---------- #}
{% if d.scope == 'month' and d.opens %}
<section>
<p class="lbl">月末持仓 · Open positions at month-end (marked to market)</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Ticker</th><th>Dir</th><th>Entry date</th><th class="r">Qty</th>
<th class="r">Entry</th><th class="r">Mark</th><th class="r">Cost basis</th><th class="r">Unrealized</th>
<th class="r">% equity</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for o in d.opens %}
<tr><td class="mono">{{ o.ticker }}</td><td>{{ o.direction }}</td><td class="mono">{{ o.entry_date }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ o.qty | num(0) }}</td><td class="r">{{ o.entry | num(2) }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ o.mark | num(2) if o.mark is not none else '—' }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ o.cost | money }}</td>
<td class="r {{ 'pos' if (o.unrealized or 0)>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ o.unrealized | money if o.unrealized is not none else '—' }}
{%- if o.upl_pct is not none %} <span class="muted">({{ o.upl_pct | pct(0) }})</span>{% endif %}</td>
<td class="r">{{ o.pct_of_equity | num(0) if o.pct_of_equity is not none else '—' }}%</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
<p class="cap">These positions were still open on the last trading day of the month — valued at the fill-anchored as-traded close, the same basis as the equity curve. Their unrealized P&amp;L is already inside the month return above.</p>
</section>{% endif %}

{# ---------- RR chart + position sizes (aligned bar-for-bar) ---------- #}
{% if d.charts.rr %}
<section>
<p class="lbl">每笔 R · Every trade by R-multiple</p>
<div class="chart">{{ chart(d.charts.rr, 'RR chart') }}</div>
{% if d.charts.sizes %}
<div class="chart" style="margin-top:14px">{{ chart(d.charts.sizes, 'Position size per trade') }}</div>
<p class="cap">仓位大小 · Position size per trade — same order as the RR chart above, so each bar lines up with its outcome. Bet-sizing / conviction calibration: do the big bets earn their size, or are the biggest positions the biggest mistakes?</p>
{% if d.size_stats %}
<table style="margin-top:6px"><thead><tr><th class="r">Avg size</th><th class="r">Biggest</th>
<th class="r">Size ↔ R correlation</th><th class="r">Loss $ from biggest-quartile positions</th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td class="r">{{ d.size_stats.avg | num(1) }}%</td>
<td class="r">{{ d.size_stats.max | num(0) }}%</td>
<td class="r {{ 'pos' if (d.size_stats.corr or 0) > 0.05 else ('neg' if (d.size_stats.corr or 0) < -0.05 else '') }}">{{ d.size_stats.corr | num(2) if d.size_stats.corr is not none else '—' }}</td>
<td class="r {{ 'neg' if (d.size_stats.loss_share_top_quartile or 0) > 40 else '' }}">{{ d.size_stats.loss_share_top_quartile | num(0) }}%</td>
</tr></tbody></table>
<p class="cap">Correlation &gt; 0 = your bigger bets tend to be the better trades (sizing adds edge); ≈ 0 = size doesn't predict outcome; &lt; 0 = the big bets underperform. The last column: what share of all losses came from the top 25% largest positions.</p>
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
</section>{% endif %}

{# ---------- Monthly + R distribution ---------- #}
<section>
<p class="lbl">{{ 'R 分布 · R-distribution' if d.scope == 'month' else '月度回报 & R 分布 · Monthly returns & R-distribution' }}</p>
{% if d.charts.monthly %}<div class="chart">{{ chart(d.charts.monthly, 'Monthly returns') }}</div>{% endif %}
{% if d.monthly_stats %}
<table style="margin-top:14px"><thead><tr><th>Month</th><th class="r">Return</th><th class="r">P&amp;L</th>
<th class="r">#</th><th class="r">Win%</th><th class="r">Days(W)</th><th class="r">Days(L)</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for m in d.monthly_stats %}
<tr><td class="mono">{{ m.month }}</td>
<td class="r {{ 'pos' if m.ret_pct>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ m.ret_pct | pct(1) }}</td>
<td class="r {{ 'pos' if m.pnl>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ m.pnl | money }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ m.n }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ m.win_pct | num(0) }}%</td>
<td class="r">{{ m.avg_hold_win | num(1) }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ m.avg_hold_loss | num(1) }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
<p class="cap">Return = compounded MTM month-over-month (same method as the dashboard Monthly Performance table); hold days by exit month.</p>
{% endif %}
{% if d.charts.rdist %}<div class="chart" style="margin-top:14px">{{ chart(d.charts.rdist, 'R distribution') }}</div>{% endif %}
</section>

{# ---------- Capital deployment ---------- #}
{% if d.charts.deployment %}
<section>
<p class="lbl">资金部署 · Capital deployment</p>
<div class="chart">{{ chart(d.charts.deployment, 'Capital deployment') }}</div>
{% if d.ce %}<table><thead><tr><th class="r">Return on deployed</th><th class="r">Avg leverage</th>
<th class="r">Peak leverage</th><th class="r">Avg deployed (of start)</th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td class="r">{{ d.ce.return_on_deployed | pct0(1) if d.ce.return_on_deployed is not none else '—' }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ (d.ce.avg_leverage_pct/100) | num(2) if d.ce.avg_leverage_pct is not none else '—' }}×</td>
<td class="r">{{ (d.ce.peak_leverage_pct/100) | num(2) if d.ce.peak_leverage_pct is not none else '—' }}×</td>
<td class="r">{{ d.ce.avg_deployed_pct_of_start | pct0(0) if d.ce.avg_deployed_pct_of_start is not none else '—' }}</td>
</tr></tbody></table>{% endif %}
</section>{% endif %}

{# ---------- Behavioral diagnosis ---------- #}
{% if d.bd %}
<section>
<p class="lbl">行为诊断 · Behavioral diagnosis</p>
<p style="font-size:13.5px;margin:0 0 6px">Losers are cut <b>fast</b> ({{ d.bd.avg_loss_hold | num(1) }}d vs winners {{ d.bd.avg_win_hold | num(1) }}d) — the leak is <b>re-attacking after the first entry goes red</b>, not bad entries. The damage is in the re-adds:</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Re-traded name</th><th class="r">Entries</th><th class="r">1st entry</th><th class="r">Re-adds after #1</th><th class="r">Net</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for r in d.bd.worst_reattack %}
<tr><td class="mono">{{ r.ticker }}</td><td class="r">{{ r.n }}</td>
<td class="r muted">{{ r.first_pnl | money }} ({{ r.first_R | signR }})</td>
<td class="r neg">{{ r.readd_pnl | money }} ({{ r.readd_R | signR }})</td>
<td class="r neg">{{ r.net | money }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
<p class="mode"><b>Mode A — averaging into a rolling name</b> (BABA: range-bound, 50d MA drooping). <b>Mode B — chasing an extended move then re-adding into the reversal</b> (CRCL/TSLL/OPEN/SOLS/INTC, re-adds after a red ≈ −$28k).</p>
{% set base = d.bd.total_pnl / d.cap * 100 %}
{% set od = (d.bd.total_pnl + d.bd.cf_onedone_pnl) / d.cap * 100 %}
{% set av = (d.bd.total_pnl + d.bd.cf_avoid_pnl) / d.cap * 100 %}
<table style="margin-top:14px"><thead><tr><th>Counterfactual</th><th class="r">P&amp;L</th><th class="r">Total R</th><th class="r">Return</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Actual</td><td class="r">{{ d.bd.total_pnl | money }}</td><td class="r">{{ d.bd.total_R | signR }}</td><td class="r">{{ base | pct(1) }}</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>One-and-done</b> (take entry #1, no re-attacks)</td><td class="r">{{ (d.bd.total_pnl + d.bd.cf_onedone_pnl) | money }}</td><td class="r">{{ (d.bd.total_R + d.bd.cf_onedone_R) | signR }}</td><td class="r pos">{{ od | pct(1) }}</td></tr>
<tr><td class="muted">Avoid all 5 entirely</td><td class="r muted">{{ (d.bd.total_pnl + d.bd.cf_avoid_pnl) | money }}</td><td class="r muted">{{ (d.bd.total_R + d.bd.cf_avoid_R) | signR }}</td><td class="r muted">{{ av | pct(1) }}</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<div class="callout">Realistic prize — <b>one-and-done: +{{ d.bd.cf_onedone_pnl | money }} / +{{ d.bd.cf_onedone_R | num(0) }}R / +{{ (od-base) | num(1) }} pts</b>. You can't un-take a first entry, but you can stop re-attacking.</div>
<p class="lbl" style="margin-top:18px">行动项 · What to do instead</p>
<ol class="act">
<li><b>One-and-done per name per thesis.</b> Red after entry #1 → no add #2/#3/#4; re-enter only on a new setup. Recovers ~{{ d.bd.cf_onedone_pnl | money }}.</li>
<li><b>Pre-commit full size at entry #1, scale only into green</b> — pyramid up, never average down. Fixes Mode A &amp; B.</li>
<li><b>Halve base 1R</b> — real 1R ≈ {{ d.bd.avg_risk_pct | num(2) }}% vs the 0.25% target (~2× size).</li>
</ol>
</section>{% endif %}

{# ---------- Trade case studies ---------- #}
{% if d.cs %}
<section>
<p class="lbl">个股复盘 · Trade case studies — technicals at entry</p>
{% if d.charts.cases %}<div class="chart">{{ chart(d.charts.cases, 'Case study charts') }}</div>{% endif %}
<table style="margin-top:14px"><thead><tr><th>Trade</th><th>Setup / mistake</th><th class="r">P&amp;L (R)</th>
<th class="r">MA stack</th><th class="r">ext</th><th class="r">hold · legs</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for row in d.cs %}
<tr>
<td class="mono">{{ row.t.ticker }} <span class="tag">{{ row.t.direction }}</span></td>
<td class="{{ 'pos' if row.win else 'neg' }}">{{ row.cls.type }}</td>
<td class="r {{ 'pos' if row.win else 'neg' }}">{{ row.t.pnl | money }} ({{ row.t.R | signR }})</td>
<td class="r mono">{% if row.tech %}{{ {'bull':'20&gt;50&gt;200','bull*':'20&gt;50','bear':'20&lt;50&lt;200','bear*':'20&lt;50','mixed':'tangled'}.get(row.tech.stack,'—') }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
<td class="r">{% if row.tech and row.tech.ext_atr is not none %}{{ row.tech.ext_atr | num(1) }} ATR{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
<td class="r">{{ row.t.hold_days }}d · {{ row.n_legs }}</td>
</tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
</section>{% endif %}

{# ---------- System quality (Van Tharp SQN) ---------- #}
{% if d.sq and d.sq.sqn %}
<section>
<p class="lbl">系统质量 · System quality (Van Tharp SQN)</p>
<div class="cards">
  <div class="card"><p class="k">SQN</p><p class="v">{{ d.sq.sqn | num(2) }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Tharp band</p><p class="v">{{ d.sq.band }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Expectancy</p><p class="v {{ 'pos' if d.sq.expectancy_R>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ d.sq.expectancy_R | signR }}</p></div>
  <div class="card"><p class="k">Stdev R</p><p class="v">{{ d.sq.stdev_R | num(2) }}</p></div>
</div>
<p class="cap"><code>SQN = √min(N,100) × (mean R ÷ stdev R)</code> — N is capped at 100; an uncapped √N inflates a long record into a band it hasn't earned. Bands: &lt;1.6 poor · 1.6–2.0 below avg · 2.0–2.5 average · 2.5–3.0 good · 3.0–5.0 excellent · 5.0–7.0 superb · ≥7.0 holy grail. Tharp grades a system by the consistency of its R-stream, not by return — raising it means tightening the loss tail, not betting bigger. Same formula as the dashboard's Sizing tab.</p>
</section>{% endif %}

{# ---------- Regime attribution ---------- #}
{% if d.charts.regime and d.charts.regime.light %}
<section>
<p class="lbl">市场状态归因 · By market conditions at entry</p>
<div class="chart">{{ chart(d.charts.regime, 'Regime attribution') }}</div>
<table style="margin-top:14px"><thead><tr><th>Band（入场时）</th><th class="r">笔数</th><th class="r">胜率</th>
<th class="r">平均 R</th><th class="r">总 R</th><th class="r">总盈亏</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for r in d.regime.rows %}{% if r.n %}
<tr><td>{{ r.band }} <span class="muted">{{ r.range }}</span></td><td class="r">{{ r.n }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ r.win_rate | num(1) }}%</td><td class="r {{ 'pos' if r.mean_R>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ r.mean_R | signR }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ r.sum_R | signR }}</td><td class="r {{ 'pos' if r.pnl>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ r.pnl | money }}</td></tr>
{% endif %}{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
<p class="cap">每笔按<b>入场当天</b>的 Market Conditions 分数归档（{{ d.regime.matched }}/{{ d.regime.total }} 匹配，可用区间 {{ d.regime.span }}）。分档用 <code>regime.py</code> 的经验四分位——它验证过对回撤频率单调；dashboard 上那套五档仓位语言是<b>显示</b>口径，两者不可混用。<br>
⚠ 该分数<b>不预测收益</b>（558 个交易日验证），只分离回撤风险；且按入场日归档，盈亏可能在之后的行情里实现——把它当风险预算的读数，不是择时信号。</p>
</section>{% endif %}

{# ---------- Deep review charts (Dario-style) ---------- #}
{% if d.charts.cum_r and d.charts.cum_r.light %}
<section>
<p class="lbl">深度复盘 · Deep review — R-equity, drawdowns, concentration, streaks</p>
<div class="chart">{{ chart(d.charts.cum_r, 'Cumulative R') }}</div>
<p class="cap">Cumulative R — equity in risk units, independent of position sizing.</p>
{% if d.charts.pareto and d.charts.pareto.light %}<div class="chart" style="margin-top:14px">{{ chart(d.charts.pareto, 'Profit concentration') }}</div>
<p class="cap">Profit concentration — a handful of trades carry the account (right-tail dependence).</p>{% endif %}
{% if d.charts.dd_dist and d.charts.dd_dist.light %}<div class="chart" style="margin-top:14px">{{ chart(d.charts.dd_dist, 'Drawdown distribution') }}</div>
<p class="cap">Every drawdown episode, not just the max — the shape of the pain.</p>{% endif %}
{% if d.charts.rolling_pf and d.charts.rolling_pf.light %}<div class="chart" style="margin-top:14px">{{ chart(d.charts.rolling_pf, 'Rolling profit factor') }}</div>
<p class="cap">Rolling 50-trade profit factor — is the edge steady or drifting?</p>{% endif %}
{% if d.charts.streaks and d.charts.streaks.light %}<div class="chart" style="margin-top:14px">{{ chart(d.charts.streaks, 'Losing streaks') }}</div>
<p class="cap">Losing streaks: observed vs the probability of hitting ≥k in a row — psychological prep.</p>{% endif %}
</section>{% endif %}

{# ---------- Position sizing to objectives (Van Tharp) ---------- #}
{% if d.charts.sizing_frontier and d.charts.sizing_frontier.light %}
<section>
<p class="lbl">仓位到目标 · Position sizing to objectives (Van Tharp, Monte-Carlo)</p>
<div class="chart">{{ chart(d.charts.sizing_frontier, 'CAGR and drawdown vs risk per trade') }}</div>
<p class="cap">Growth vs pain as you vary risk-per-trade — bootstrap of your own R-distribution. CAGR keeps rising with risk, but drawdown rises faster; the objective is the risk % that meets your return goal within a drawdown you can survive — NOT the max.</p>
{% if d.charts.risk_ruin and d.charts.risk_ruin.light %}<div class="chart" style="margin-top:14px">{{ chart(d.charts.risk_ruin, 'Risk of ruin') }}</div>
<p class="cap">Risk of ruin — P(a &gt;50% drawdown) vs risk-per-trade, under your historical edge, a −0.3R haircut, and zero edge. ⚠ The historical curve is flattered by a strong sample; the pessimistic/zero-edge lines are the honest guardrails.</p>{% endif %}
</section>{% endif %}

{# ---------- Contribution tables ---------- #}
<section>
<p class="lbl">贡献 · By direction &amp; top tickers</p>
<div class="two">
<div><table><thead><tr><th>Direction</th><th class="r">P&amp;L</th><th class="r">n</th><th class="r">Win%</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for k,v in d.by_dir %}<tr><td>{{ k }}</td><td class="r {{ 'pos' if v.pnl>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ v.pnl | money }}</td>
<td class="r">{{ v.n }}</td><td class="r">{{ (v.wins/v.n*100) | num(0) }}%</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<div><table><thead><tr><th>Ticker</th><th class="r">P&amp;L</th><th class="r">n</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for k,v in d.by_tk %}<tr><td class="mono">{{ k }}</td>
<td class="r {{ 'pos' if v.pnl>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ v.pnl | money }}</td><td class="r">{{ v.n }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="foot"><span>Fluxus Capital · {{ d.handle }}</span>
<span>source {{ d.source }} · numbers reconcile with the .md/.json review</span></div>

</div>
<script>
(function(){
  var r=document.documentElement, b=document.getElementById('themebtn');
  function set(t){r.setAttribute('data-theme',t);b.textContent=t==='light'?'◐ Dark':'◑ Light';
    try{localStorage.setItem('fluxusReportTheme',t)}catch(e){}}
  var saved; try{saved=localStorage.getItem('fluxusReportTheme')}catch(e){}
  set(saved||'dark');
  b.addEventListener('click',function(){set(r.getAttribute('data-theme')==='light'?'dark':'light')});
})();
</script>
</body></html>
